{
  "title": "Natural Products Expo West 参展价值评估报告",
  "category": "展会评估",
  "date": "2026-10-13",
  "readTime": 10,
  "prevId": "ayumi-target-customer-evaluation-2026",
  "nextId": null,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "一、决策摘要"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"data-card data-card--score\"><div style=\"font-size:48px;color:#d48806;\">69<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"> / 100</span></div><div class=\"section-label\" style=\"color:#d48806;\">值得观展开发客户，适合小规模试水</div></div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "text": "Natural Products Expo West值得仅一参加，重点是开发美国营养保健品品牌和条包代工客户。建议先观展并预约交流，有明确客户会面安排时可考虑小展位。营养粉、功能固体饮料和Stick条包是最适合仅一切入的业务方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>展会名称</td><td>Natural Products Expo West</td></tr><tr><td>下一届时间</td><td>2027年3月2—5日；展厅开放3月3—5日 <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a></td></tr><tr><td>地点</td><td>美国加利福尼亚州阿纳海姆，Anaheim Convention Center</td></tr><tr><td>业务定位</td><td>天然、有机及健康消费品行业交流平台，连接品牌、零售渠道、原料、代工和生产技术供应商</td></tr><tr><td>评估依据</td><td>2027年参展决策，结合2026年官方展商名录、企业参展公告及具体产品展示</td></tr><tr><td>仅一重点方向</td><td>食品与保健品Stick条包、营养粉灌装、软袋包装和包装创新</td></tr><tr><td>建议参与方式</td><td>专业观展与客户约访；有明确会面安排时采用小展位</td></tr><tr><td>综合得分</td><td>69/100；综合判断置信度：中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>评分维度</th><th>得分</th><th>核心判断</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域入口价值</td><td>12/20</td><td>美国营养健康产业入口较强，品牌和代工企业均有参与</td></tr><tr><td>业务与产品相关性</td><td>23/30</td><td>条包与营养粉匹配突出，软袋和集成包装有业务基础</td></tr><tr><td>赛道展商信号</td><td>16/30</td><td>有美国同行及多家设备供应商，核心整线设备集聚程度一般</td></tr><tr><td>展会可信度与影响力</td><td>18/20</td><td>长期运营、规模大，行业机构与大型企业持续参与</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>69/100</td><td>谨慎，适合观展或小规模试水</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "综合判断：客户开发价值较强，设备展位投入宜适度。赛道展商信号为16/30，建议采用观展或小规模试水的参与方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "最关键的正面证据"
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        "Intermountain Nutrition明确将四类Stick条包列为2026年Expo West重点展示产品，覆盖补水、纤维、运动营养和蛋白方向。<a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/samples-of-our-stock-formulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a>",
        "官方名录列有All-Fill、Federal Equipment、CDA USA、Tetra Pak和NiMCO，生产与包装技术供应商有实际参与。<a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a>",
        "Orgain、Glanbia Performance Nutrition、Garden of Life／Nuun／Solgar／Vital Proteins，以及GreenSeed、Intermountain Nutrition等品牌和代工企业形成了具体客户开发对象。<a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://greenseedcp.com/category/news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "最终建议"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "将Expo West列入仅一美国营养保健品客户开发的候选展会。第一次参加以专业观展、提前约访和包装样品交流为主，重点讨论条包新品、营养粉包装升级及规模化生产。小展位以包装样品、应用案例、产线视频和洽谈为核心，投入与已安排的客户会面相匹配。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "美国市场展会分工：Expo West侧重品牌、代工厂和产品创新交流；PACK EXPO侧重设备展示、加工包装方案及整线项目洽谈。仅一的大型设备参展预算优先评估PACK EXPO。<a href=\"https://www.packexpolasvegas.com/the-show/faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[13]</a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "二、与仅一相关的企业和产品"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "1. 条包与营养粉：最值得切入的客户方向"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>企业</th><th>2026年展位</th><th>具体业务或展示</th><th>仅一切入方向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Intermountain Nutrition</td><td>3468</td><td>展会重点条包：Hydration + Fiber、Creatine + Caffeine、Pre-Workout、Clear Protein；美国营养品制造企业 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/samples-of-our-stock-formulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/about/frequently-asked-questions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a></td><td>Stick条包、粉剂包装与规模化生产</td></tr><tr><td>GreenSeed External Manufacturing</td><td>599</td><td>官网确认参展，服务功能营养粉、超级食物混合粉等健康产品；条包和小袋代工方向明确 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://greenseedcp.com/category/news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a></td><td>条包代工产线、粉体包装及后道自动化</td></tr><tr><td>Orgain</td><td>N2140、N2141</td><td>官方名录列有该营养品牌，产品覆盖蛋白粉等营养粉 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://orgain.com/collections/protein-powder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">产品页</a></td><td>营养粉包装、便携单次包装和产品线延伸</td></tr><tr><td>Glanbia Performance Nutrition</td><td>4015</td><td>官方名录列有运动营养业务；Glanbia原料业务另在1045号展位展示适用于即冲粉等产品的营养方案 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.glanbianutrition.com/en/nutri-knowledge-center/events/partner-us-expo-west-explore-metabolic-health-and-weight-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[10]</a></td><td>运动营养粉、功能固体饮料及包装创新</td></tr><tr><td>Garden of Life、Nuun、Solgar、Vital Proteins</td><td>3879</td><td>官方名录确认以联合品牌名称参展 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a></td><td>按具体产品筛选营养补充剂、粉剂与单次包装机会</td></tr><tr><td>Arizona Nutritional Supplements</td><td>4774</td><td>官方名录列有该营养品制造企业 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a></td><td>营养品制造与包装业务交流</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Intermountain Nutrition的四类条包产品最能体现Expo West与仅一的直接联系：同一包装形态覆盖补水、膳食纤维、运动前营养和蛋白补充，适合围绕产品系列化与制造效率展开交流。其包装服务同时包含Stick、Sachet、软袋、桶罐和瓶装，具有多种包装形式之间的业务延伸空间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "品牌端重点讨论新品和包装升级，代工端重点讨论产能、品种切换及后道自动化。客户开发应同时覆盖这两类企业，让产品需求与实际生产主体相互衔接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "2. 设备与技术供应商：有生产端业务，但重叠程度不同"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>企业</th><th>2026年展位</th><th>设备或方案证据</th><th>业务相关性</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>All-Fill</td><td>4435</td><td>官方名录确认；公司产品覆盖粉体螺杆灌装和制袋包装 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.all-fill.com/equipment/auger-fillers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a></td><td>仅一美国粉体灌装与软袋设备同行</td></tr><tr><td>Federal Equipment</td><td>3574</td><td>企业参展页列有Hassia条包机展会优惠，经营制造及包装二手设备 <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a></td><td>条包设备和本地设备交易网络</td></tr><tr><td>CDA USA</td><td>2604、3342</td><td>官网发布灌装、旋盖、贴标设备参展及现场演示计划 <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a></td><td>瓶装包装配套；与仅一核心包装形式重叠较少</td></tr><tr><td>Tetra Pak</td><td>4913</td><td>官网确认食品饮料加工与包装方案参展 <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>食品生产与包装技术业务开发</td></tr><tr><td>NiMCO</td><td>N107</td><td>官方名录确认；主营屋顶型纸盒成型灌装封口设备 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://nimco.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">产品介绍</a></td><td>包装生产端相关，纸盒方向与仅一主线重叠较少</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "这些企业的参与说明Expo West具备生产技术交流场景。其中All-Fill与仅一的粉体灌装和软袋方向更接近，Federal提供条包设备业务线索；CDA、Tetra Pak和NiMCO主要服务其他包装形式。仅一可借此了解美国品牌与制造企业如何选择包装方案，并接触本地生产服务网络。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "CDA官网已列出2027年继续参加Expo West的计划，显示包装设备企业将该展作为持续开发自然健康产品客户的渠道。<a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/news-cda-labeling-filling-machines/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[15]</a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "三、评分明细"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "1. 区域入口价值：12/20"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域代表性</td><td>4/4</td><td>美国大型天然健康产品行业展，持续运营45年 <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>仅一相关行业入口</td><td>2/4</td><td>营养保健品、食品品牌及合同制造商均有参与 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/approved-categories/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[11]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>本地适配产业覆盖</td><td>3/4</td><td>品牌、原料、代工和设备供应商形成多环节覆盖 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.glanbianutrition.com/en/nutri-knowledge-center/events/partner-us-expo-west-explore-metabolic-health-and-weight-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[10]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>生产端场景明确度</td><td>2/4</td><td>制造服务和设备演示有具体企业证据；全展主线侧重成品业务 <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/about/frequently-asked-questions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://attend.expowest.com/event/natural-products-expo-west-2026/planning/UGxhbm5pbmdfMzU1NDA1MQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[12]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>同区域替代性</td><td>1/4</td><td>品牌开发有价值；PACK EXPO的设备与整线场景更直接 <a href=\"https://www.packexpolasvegas.com/the-show/faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[13]</a></td><td>高</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Expo West适合作为仅一进入美国营养健康产业的接触窗口。品牌、合同制造商、原料企业与设备供应商同场交流，便于从产品方向追踪到生产合作与包装需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "展会的买家安排主要服务成品选品与渠道合作。对仅一来说，有效参与方式是主动约访品牌和制造企业，把广泛的行业交流转化为具体的包装业务洽谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "2. 业务与产品相关性：23/30"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>核心应用行业匹配</td><td>6/6</td><td>食品、营养保健品、运动营养和营养粉有直接证据 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/samples-of-our-stock-formulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.glanbianutrition.com/en/nutri-knowledge-center/events/partner-us-expo-west-explore-metabolic-health-and-weight-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[10]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>包装设备场景</td><td>4/6</td><td>灌装、包装方案和设备演示有企业公告支撑 <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>Stick条包信号</td><td>6/6</td><td>四类Expo West重点条包产品及条包设备优惠 <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/samples-of-our-stock-formulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>听装／粉体信号</td><td>4/6</td><td>粉体制造和灌装相关性强，包装以条包、桶罐等形式展开 <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/about/frequently-asked-questions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a> <a href=\"https://www.all-fill.com/equipment/auger-fillers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>软袋／整线信号</td><td>3/6</td><td>参展制造商提供软袋包装，设备商产品覆盖集成包装 <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/about/frequently-asked-questions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a> <a href=\"https://www.all-fill.com/equipment/auger-fillers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "仅一最适合切入食品和保健品Stick条包，尤其是功能固体饮料、运动营养粉、蛋白及膳食纤维类产品。展会的具体条包展示使这一方向具有明确业务基础。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "粉体灌装和软袋包装可作为延伸交流方向。听装奶粉与大型交钥匙整线在本展中的业务信号相对较弱，第一次参与应集中展示最有对应产品支撑的条包应用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "3. 赛道展商信号：16/30"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域同行／本地设备商</td><td>4/6</td><td>All-Fill、Federal等有官方名录或企业参展确认 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>清单内国际同行</td><td>3/6</td><td>仅一同行清单中的All-Fill列入2026年官方名录 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.all-fill.com/equipment/auger-fillers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>重叠产品展示</td><td>2/6</td><td>条包机优惠明确；现场演示证据主要来自瓶装设备 <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>相关设备商数量</td><td>3/6</td><td>多家灌装、包装和加工技术供应商参与，设备方向较分散 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>展商信息可验证性</td><td>4/6</td><td>官方名录与多家企业参展页可交叉核验，展品说明完整度不一 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.expowest.com/ew26/Public/eventmap.aspx?EventId=1085&MapID=1000781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/naturalproducts-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/es/actualidades-cda-maquinas-llenado-etiquetado/natural-products-expo-west-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "美国本地设备商与国际生产技术供应商均有参与，说明Expo West能够支持设备和技术业务开发。All-Fill为仅一粉体与软袋业务提供了较直接的同赛道信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "设备商参与的包装方向较分散，核心条包、金属听装粉剂和软袋整线的集聚程度一般。这个结构更适合围绕客户产品开展包装方案交流，设备展位宜采用轻量展示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "4. 展会可信度与影响力：18/20"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>主办方可信度</td><td>4/4</td><td>New Hope Network运营，属于Informa体系 <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>历史稳定性</td><td>4/4</td><td>官网明确45年历史 <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>规模与趋势</td><td>4/4</td><td>官网展示66,000+观众、3,200+展商及110+到访国家 <a href=\"https://www.expowest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>行业背书</td><td>3/4</td><td>Organic Trade Association等行业机构参与 <a href=\"https://ota.com/organic-expo-west\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[14]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>行业参与与口碑</td><td>3/4</td><td>大型企业参展、代工企业发布产品及设备商持续参加 <a href=\"https://intermountainnutrition.com/samples-of-our-stock-formulations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.tetrapak.com/en-us/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/events/Expo-West-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a> <a href=\"https://www.glanbianutrition.com/en/nutri-knowledge-center/events/partner-us-expo-west-explore-metabolic-health-and-weight-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[10]</a> <a href=\"https://cda-usa.com/news-cda-labeling-filling-machines/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[15]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "长期运营、较大的行业覆盖和知名企业参与，为Expo West提供了稳定的行业影响力。其美国营养健康产品交流平台的价值较强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "对仅一而言，参展决策的重点应落在业务目标与投入方式：利用展会接触品牌和制造企业，并以条包、营养粉及包装创新作为主要交流内容。"
    },
